 #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]kill-last-keymap-resolved[dim] · [dim][/dim]after launch-record-stack[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]kill-last-keymap-resolved: register kill_and_edit_last on key X across [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]all eight keymap surfaces plus docs, refactor _kill_and_edit_agent to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]take an explicit target, and make `,X` reveal and kill-and-edit resolved[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]launch records (bulk fan-out included), with an interim toast for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in-flight records.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]In-flight deferred kill[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]deferred-kill-inflight[dim] · [dim][/dim]after kill-last-keymap-resolved[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]deferred-kill-inflight: make `,X` on an in-flight launch restore the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt immediately and kill the launched agents from the completion [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]callback, holding replacement launches until the kill settles, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed-admission scoping, failure handling, and race tests.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-w8","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","phase_bead_id":"sase-w8.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-4f256b9cdb5df0d0b8782736f7d77e1e","started_at":"2026-09-03T17:06:06.878725","state":"dismissed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1788523499,"sha":"51c3fbcd5f487af273c0ff74871a3e7f990122fa","subject":"feat(ace): defer in-flight ,X kill until launch completion"}],"dismissed_at":"2026-09-04T08:08:36.925917","files":{"chat":{"digest":"9220a7fdeb2b7f08538a0c8050249209776ffcab74e147b925ec3cc67ba64d21","path":"agents/bbugyi200.kelly